  "prefLabel": "Tra 903.08 Lost Registration Decal or Certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tra 903.08 Lost Registration Decal or Certificate.\n\n(a) A registrant shall notify the bureau immediately upon discovery that a registration certificate or decal has been lost or mutilated.\n\n(b) Upon receipt of the fee set forth in RSA 422:31, VIII, the bureau shall issue a certified replacement certificate, decal, or both, reflecting the same expiration date as the lost or mutilated item(s).\n\nSource. #10034, eff 11-23-11 (from Tra 902.08)\n\nNew. #13480, eff 11-3-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tra900.html"
